{"version":1,"content":"<p>雖然NVIDIA董事長已明確表態沒有讓黃仁勳重返CEO崗位的計劃，但公司董事會內部仍有人推動其回歸，雙方意見出現分歧。報道稱，<strong>約有3名董事不認同拒絕黃仁勳復職的立場，黃仁勳本人也曾與至少一名董事討論重返NVIDIA的可能性，</strong>相關接觸發生在NVIDIA發佈財報、董事長公開表態之前。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587078.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T05:43:54.887728+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T05:20:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T05:37:14.223023+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T05:37:14.223023+00:00","content_hash":"1f0c0c933c6d54317f88836878e8d5cb0dfc5cdfa408fc869d35a807325b8675","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}